|---|------|---------------|
| 1 | `component_if` | `{#if}` inside component template |
| 2 | `component_each` | `{#each}` inside component template |
| 3 | `error_full` | Error page with `<go>`, `<head>`, `<script>`, `<style>` |
| 4 | `loop_full` | All `$loop` fields (First, Last, Even, Odd) |
| 5 | `go_multiple` | Two `<go>` sections |
| 6 | `go_typed_both` | `<go type="json">` + `<go type="xml">` together |
| 7 | `go_custom_type` | `<go type="custom">` |
| 8 | `if_in_each` | `{#if}` nested inside `{#each}` |
| 9 | `each_in_if` | `{#each}` nested inside `{#if}` |
| 10 | `form_missing_struct` | `g-action` with no matching struct |
| 11 | `component_go` | Component with `<go>` block |
| 12 | `component_style` | Component with `<style>` section |
| 13 | `slot_bare` | Bare `{#slot}` in component |
| 14 | `slot_named_default` | Named slot with default content in component |
