## Bugs to Fix (before tests)

| # | Bug | File:Line |
|---|-----|-----------|
| B1 | `genTemplateNodeComp` missing `NodeIf`/`NodeEach` cases | `core/codegen.go:477-508` |
| B2 | `BindForm` panics on non-string fields | `core/validate.go:29` |
| B3 | `scopeCSS` breaks `@media` queries | `core/codegen_template.go:141-154` |
| B4 | `hasValidateTag`/`hasFormTag` ignore `structName` param | `core/forms.go:63-79` |
| B5 | `splitGoSections` misclassifies type with comment prefix | `core/codegen.go:211-216` |
| B6 | `findMain` never matches `cmd/` directory | `cmd/dreego/main.go:272` |
| B7 | `make generate`/`make dev` broken | `Makefile:12,15` |
| B8 | Landing blueprint `config.json` wrong type | `cmd/dreego/blueprints/landing/dreego/config.json:2` |
| B9 | `AssertRedirect` uses `strings.Contains` | `dreegotest/dreegotest.go:85` |
| B10 | `Body()` swallows read errors | `dreegotest/dreegotest.go:61` |
| B11 | `SetReady`/`readyHandler` data race | `core/middleware_health.go:5-8` |
| B12 | `crypto/rand.Read` errors ignored | `core/middleware_csrf.go:47` |
| B13 | `scanComponents`/`findLayout` swallow all errors | `core/generate.go:375-446` |
| B14 | `GenerateComponent` ignores `<go>` after `Go[0]` | `core/codegen.go:448` |
| B15 | `cleanSegment("[[opt]]")` returns `"[opt]"` | `core/generate.go:348-350` |
| B16 | `extractAttrValues` splits on spaces in brace expressions | `core/codegen_template.go:173-195` |
| B17 | `atoi` silently eats non-digits | `core/validate.go:92-99` |
| B18 | `unindent` only handles tabs, not spaces | `core/codegen.go:226-251` |
| B19 | `findFormStruct` regex fails on named returns | `core/forms.go:46` |
| B20 | `dreego run -t` uses SIGKILL not SIGTERM | `cmd/dreego/main.go:243` |
